# Local-only reference material (old exploratory work, course PDFs, the
# original project brief) — kept on disk for personal reference, never
# published.
draft/

# Claude Code tooling config (local session state, not project content) —
# except launch.json, which documents how to run the Streamlit dev server.
.claude/*
!.claude/launch.json

# reports/figures/*.png and reports/results/*.csv are intentionally NOT
# ignored: the README embeds the figures directly, and the Streamlit app
# reads the results CSVs so it has content on a fresh clone without first
# waiting ~15-20 min for `run_benchmark.py` to finish. Both are still fully
# reproducible from the commands in the README.
